  "fiction_rules": [
    "every name comes from a fixed invented word list; no real company, person, address or phone number",
    "hosts end in .invalid (RFC 6761); IPs are RFC 5737 (192.0.2.0/24, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24) or RFC 3849 (2001:db8::/32)",
    "phone numbers are in the 555-0100..0199 fiction block",
    "people appear only as roles (role entity)",
    "the only credential value anywhere is change-me"
  ]
